{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03739","headline":"送光禄刘主簿之洛 · 李峤","name":"送光禄刘主簿之洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"函谷双崤右，伊川二陕东。\n仙舟窅将隔，芳斝暂云同。\n朋席余欢尽，文房旧侣空。\n他乡千里月，岐路九秋风。\n背枥嘶班马，分洲呌断鸿。\n别後青山外，相望白云中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}